Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Permission denied when collecting logs

Solution: Some log files require sudo access. Use sudo cp or run collection script with elevated privileges where appropriate.
Issue: Memory dump file is empty or very small

Solution: Ensure sufficient disk space. Check that psutil is properly installed: pip3 install psutil
Issue: Volatility commands fail

Solution: Verify Volatility installation: vol.py --help. For simulated dumps, ensure your script handles the custom format correctly.
Issue: Timeline has no events

Solution: Check that evidence collection completed successfully. Verify log files exist in the case directory.
